  "_": "ONE-BUNDLE SHOWCASE #2 — the second parallel batch in a single coc. (1) PROJ+EXPL: a custom firebolt spell with its OWN flying bolt + fire boom; learn it in-game from a placed SPELL TOME, then cast it. (2) NPC INVENTORY: Borin carries a custom sword (he draws it in the brawl) + 100 gold (lootable). (3) SCENE CONDITIONS: the argue-scene is gated on a GLOB (MF_ShowGate) — it plays while the global == 0; `set MF_ShowGate to 1` in console and it stops firing. All vanilla art FormIDs verified against Skyrim.esm. Test: coc RiverwoodSleepingGiantInn (save+reload on an old save) -> grab + read the 'Tome: Forged Firebolt' on the counter to learn the spell, equip + cast it at a wall (custom bolt + boom). Stand near Borin & Hilda -> they argue + brawl (Borin wields the custom sword). Then `set MF_ShowGate to 1`, leave + return -> no more arguing (scene condition). Bundles MFSceneBanterController.pex automatically.",

